{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Who brought you out of the land of Egypt to be for you an El.</b> To guide you without intermediary, after the manner of those separated from matter — provided you walk in the ways of My holiness, as it says: אֶל דֶּרֶךְ הַגּוֹיִם אַל תִּלְמָדוּ וּמֵאֹתוֹת הַשָּׁמַיִם אַל תֵּחָתוּ (Jeremiah 10:2)." "<b>I am YHWH.</b> I have not changed, and I will act as of old — if your transgressions do not separate between you and your El, as it says (Micah 7:15): כִּימֵי צֵאתְךָ מֵאֶרֶץ מִצְרַיִם אַרְאֶנּוּ נִפְלָאוֹת."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:25.503472234Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}